# Frontend environment (Vite). Copy to .env.local to override locally.
#
# VITE_API_URL is the ONLY configurable API base and must include the "/api"
# suffix. Leave it unset for the recommended local setup: the app calls the
# same-origin "/api" path and the Vite dev server proxies it to the backend
# (see vite.config.ts). That avoids CORS and keeps the HttpOnly auth cookies
# first-party, matching the server's SameSite=lax default.
#
# Point at the backend directly instead (cross-origin; needs server CORS
# CLIENT_URL to match this app's origin):
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
#
# Optional dev-server proxy target. Defaults to http://localhost:5000, which
# matches server/.env.example PORT=5000.
# VITE_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:5000
